{"reviewId": "340650017_88bsW5nG6", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "是不是有点不适应，繁荣和衰退应该是下降期，而萧条和回升应该是回升期呀？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2025-2121", "abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "340650017_88bsW5nG6", "userVid": 340650017, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775545074, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 340650017, "name": "所念皆星河", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Xewa2JUmZ1qTbxRcj7qxwF3oBwGABAX0zDLxic0L0nCTJECEqXbUXRg/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "所念皆星河", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "独行者速，众行者远。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241209-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "你可以理解成一个波，前面一大段飞速上升为繁荣，上升减慢到不在上升为衰退，飞速下降为萧条，下降减慢到不再下降为回升", "reviewId": "340650017_88bsW5nG6", "commentId": "340650017_88bsW5nG6_c341837822_88gcjui6C", "userVid": 341837822, "createTime": 1775813847, "likesCount": 4, "isLike": 0, "author": {"userVid": 341837822, "name": "家驹", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/e3LZWjQELT8jkoqwPWh86fYOdLtFU4vJWopvBa246Pphgx8L8XooQH9SuXItEWQ5jrpaVOlGhrO4QeEhokWEsSzN2R0wwLib28mMInMDdxib0/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": f